From: lzc256 <i@lzc256.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 10:20:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add custom balance script support for channels

- Add balance_script field in ChannelOtherSettings for custom Python scripts
- Add BalanceScriptState column for persisting script state (max 64KB)
- Execute scripts via prlimit with CPU/memory/process limits
- Pass channel info via env vars: CHANNEL_BASE_URL, CHANNEL_KEY, CHANNEL_TYPE, CHANNEL_ID, CHANNEL_IS_MULTI_KEY, CHANNEL_STATE
- Output: JSON {balance, state} or plain number (backward compatible)
- RestrictedPython: compile_restricted + safe_builtins + safer_getattr + import whitelist
- seccomp: allow read-only open + network, deny write/execve/fork
- Atomic state update with GetChannelPollingLock serialization
- Add BalanceScriptField component in frontend drawer
- Update Dockerfile to install python3, RestrictedPython, python3-seccomp
